# Internal-references ban for scripts/oss-gate.sh (STAGE R).
#
# Format, one per line ('#' lines and blank lines are ignored):
#   <class><TAB><PCRE><TAB><probe>   matched with git grep -P against every tracked text file. The
#                                    probe is a synthetic hit: scripts/test/internal-refs-ban.test.sh
#                                    plants it in a scratch repo and requires RED naming the class.
#   <class><TAB>word:<word>          a whole TOKEN. A token is a maximal [a-z0-9] run after
#                                    percent-escapes are removed and camelCase is split, lowercased:
#                                    `sessRidge`, `P_RIDGE`, `x%2Fridge` all yield the token `ridge`.
#   <class><TAB>sha256:<hex>         a token whose sha256 is listed. Used for personal and customer
#                                    names, so this public file does not spell them out. Obscured,
#                                    not secret: a dictionary reverses a common name. Check a word
#                                    with  printf '%s' word | sha256sum
# Each regex is also tested across every pair of consecutive lines (the second line's comment
# marker stripped), so a reference wrapped onto the next comment line is still caught.
# A hit is RED unless an entry in scripts/oss-gate/internal-refs.allow covers it.
#
# This file and the allow-list are the only paths the scan skips: they necessarily contain the
# patterns, the probes and the allowed literals.
#
# The classes are what a public release of this repository must not carry: the names of the people
# and agents of the team that built it and of its customers, its company brand outside the public
# repository URL, its private repositories, its hosts, addresses and host paths, its private
# notification channel, and references into its private task tracker.
person	sha256:f3fe5a51a2be8c6dc715028858fcba82ee021be7687e4f95b45086b8ffb1a23f
agent	word:ridge
agent	word:foreman
agent	word:foremen
agent	word:inspector
agent	word:inspectors
agent	word:tesla
agent	word:squire
agent	word:librarian
agent	word:fable
tenant	sha256:de7ee76e7373c19bf7418e69cadecba96107bbb6d99524c516e1d37605dca829
tenant	sha256:6743628ed9b8c62438923bda3d0bb7d34955b3bc67cf92ef5cf0387233cbe7e8
tenant	sha256:9cdb47c559417464c6ee37cf19787d92e12728456e547f73cb981708bbc17532
tenant	sha256:2f224e17f67d8c3d107843855362863f4ff5b715a0d4d61cf49a6607b7731598
tenant	sha256:7fad6a9089ae4c73919d9d58c200a4cf6c08dcf9a6d9e4da864dcdd08d37b81d
tenant	sha256:6a41a1f75332aa1e3552c8ed6a5c0061c1cdc9864dd8830e0b72eb7ac1123723
tenant	sha256:7d0bcb4304d3635db25b3cc87c8583830db337cac39c437da80c7642d3d3e127
